SCOPE — what this licence does NOT cover
----------------------------------------

The MIT grant above applies ONLY to material originated by the author of this
package. That means:

  * the structure and wording of the capability cards,
  * the pipeline and audit scripts,
  * the packaging code (startup.js, cordis.patch.yml, package.json),
  * the findings, recomputations, tables and defect analyses produced by the
    distillation pipeline.

It does NOT apply to material derived from the source work identified in
NOTICE. In particular:

  * the source book's facts, data, formulae and physical relationships —
    these are not copyrightable subject matter in the first place, and no
    claim is made over them;
  * any summary whose substance is attributable to the source book — the
    copyright in that underlying subject matter remains with the author,
    the translators and the publisher named in NOTICE.

No licence, express or implied, is granted over the source book itself, over
any translation of it, or over its typographical arrangement. If you want to
reproduce the book, obtain it from its publisher.

This package is an independent commentary and engineering distillation. It is
not affiliated with, authorised by, sponsored by, or endorsed by the author,
the translators, or 清华大学出版社 / Tsinghua University Press. The book is
named in NOTICE for the purpose of attribution and criticism only.

The package is not a substitute for the book. Several capability cards exist
precisely to record where the book is internally inconsistent, misprinted or
unreadable after scanning; readers who need the original argument should
consult the printed text.
